<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Office started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - U.S. Office started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of U.S. Office Products Co with strong buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- In midsession New York Stock Exchange trade, the shares rose 1-1/8 to 26-7/8.</p>
</text>
